                <pb facs="0693" n="686" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg686"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/11159: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Tsingtao</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Sokobin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-11-17T20:00:00-05:00">November 17, 1937—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 16, 5 p.m. The Department assumes that you, bearing in mind the
                    Department’s August 7, 4 p.m., do not intend to interview the mayor as and for
                    the purpose requested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
